// ============================================================
// FILE: TraderSellPopup.layout   (compact item-sell window)
// Conventions taken from the vanilla examples in gui/layouts:
//   * centred window:  WindowWidget size 0.46 0.52 + halign/valign center_ref
//     + position 0 0   (same idiom as day_z_book.layout BackPanelWidget 0.475 0.9)
//   * every widget states hexactpos/vexactpos/hexactsize/vexactsize explicitly -
//     98% of vanilla widgets do (only 154 of 9294 omit them) and the engine's
//     default for a missing flag is not reliable.
//   * position is an OFFSET FROM THE ANCHOR POINT chosen by halign/valign:
//       left_ref/top_ref -> parent origin, center_ref -> parent centre,
//       right_ref/bottom_ref -> parent far edge. Negative offsets move the widget
//       back inside (e.g. close button: halign right_ref + position -0.008 ...).
//   * fraction (hexact*=0) vs pixels (hexact*=1): both are used; a centred
//     window is usually a fraction of the screen, small controls (dot, close)
//     keep fractions of their card so they scale with it.
//   * fonts/sizes follow the vanilla distribution:
//       sdf_MetronLight24 @ 18  (355 uses) / @ 22 (377)  -> body, statuses
//       sdf_MetronBook24  @ 24  (57)                     -> item name
//       sdf_MetronBold24  @ 22                           -> price
//   * the amount slider uses the vanilla slider definition
//     (new_ui/option_slider.layout): style Default, color 1 1 1 0.549,
//     "fill in" 1, "listen to input" 1, and a height close to a vanilla row
//     slider (0.55 of a ~40 px row -> here 0.12 of the 0.418 high footer).
//   * the seven status lines are stacked with a native GridSpacerWidgetClass
//     (Columns 1 / Rows 7) exactly like camera_tools.layout and option lists.
//
// REQUIRED widget names (vanilla InspectMenuNew.SetItem writes into them and
// dereferences ItemFrameWidget without a null check):
//   InventoryInfoPanelWidget, ItemFrameWidget, ItemNameWidget, ItemDamageWidget,
//   ItemLiquidTypeWidget, ItemTemperatureWidget, ItemWetnessWidget,
//   ItemFoodStageWidget, ItemWeightWidget, ItemQuantityWidget,
//   ItemCleannessWidget, ItemDescWidget, BackBtn1 (userID 2 = IDC_CANCEL)
// Sell area: SellRow, SellRowBg, SellPriceWidget, SellAmountWidget, SellSlider,
//   SellButton (userID 90012), SellButtonRed, NoPriceWidget
// ============================================================
FrameWidgetClass rootFrame {
 clipchildren 1
 ignorepointer 0
 color 1 1 1 1
 position 0 0
 size 1 1
 hexactpos 0
 vexactpos 0
 hexactsize 0
 vexactsize 0
 priority 2
 {
  // ---- centred compact card -------------------------------------------
